{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019pEQzkJo9mb6daTsPiVuMX","type":"tool_result","content":"import re\n\n# Step 1: complaints about the exchange rate on a card payment or cash\n# withdrawal go to fees_fx, even when they say the amount looks wrong.\n# \"ex\\w*\" tolerates typos such as \"exhange\" or \"exchnage\".\n_FX_RATE = re.compile(\n    r\"\\b(ex\\w*|currency|conversion|fx|forex)\\s+rates?\\b\", re.I)\n_BARE_RATE = re.compile(r\"\\brates?\\b\", re.I)\n_RATE_COMPLAINT = re.compile(\n    r\"\\b(wrong|incorrect|bad|error|mistake|correct|inaccurate|poor|unfair|\"\n    r\"terrible|awful|off|applied|interbank|higher|lower|worse)\\b\", re.I)\n# Exchange-rate complaints with the word \"rate\" missing: \"charged the\n# wrong amount for an item\" (also the \"wing amount\" typo seen in the data).\n_WRONG_ITEM_AMOUNT = re.compile(\n    r\"\\b(wrong|wing|incorrect)\\s+amount\\b.*\\b(item|purchase|product|\"\n    r\"bought|thing)\\b\", re.I)\n# Getting cash in another currency at an ATM and asking about the cost.\n_ATM_CURRENCY_COST = re.compile(\n    r\"(?=.*\\b(atm|withdraw\\w*|cash)\\b)(?=.*\\bcurrenc\\w*\\b)\"\n    r\"(?=.*\\b(cost|fee|fees|charge\\w*|rate)\\b)\", re.I | re.S)\n\n\ndef _is_fx_rate_complaint(text):\n    if _FX_RATE.search(text):\n        return True\n    if _BARE_RATE.search(text) and _RATE_COMPLAINT.search(text):\n        return True\n    if _WRONG_ITEM_AMOUNT.search(text):\n        return True\n    return bool(_ATM_CURRENCY_COST.search(text))\n\n\ndef route(text, laya_dept):\n    if _is_fx_rate_complaint(text):\n        return \"fees_fx\"\n    return laya_dept\ntext\tlaya_answer\tcorrect\nCan someone assist me with explaining how I can unblock my pin?\taccount_security\tcards\nI have used all of my PIN tries. What should I do now?\taccount_security\tcards\nMy account is locked because I used the wrong pin too many times.  Please help.p\taccount_security\tcards\nHow can I change my PIN even though I'm out of the country in Austria at the moment?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan you tell me how to change my PIN?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan you unblock my blocked pin?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan I change my pin at ATMs?  If so, what ones?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan I reset my PIN?\taccount_security\tcards\n\nI put the wrong pin too many times and now it is blocked. Can you help me unblock it?\taccount_security\tcards\nHow many times can I enter a wrong PIN before it is blocked?\taccount_security\tcards\nI may have entered the PIN wrong and the account is blocked.  What do I have to do to get it unblocked.\tdisputes\tcards\nWhere do I go to unblock my PIN?\taccount_security\tcards\nWhere am I able to get my PIN unblocked?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan my PIN be changed in any cash machine?\taccount_security\tcards\nChanging my PIN\taccount_security\tcards\nI accidentally exceeded my PIN tries.  Please advise.\taccount_security\tcards\nWhat is the delivery time for US?\tcards\tcards\nWhere do you export the cards to?\tcards\tcards\nI want to start using my card.\tcards\tcards\nWhat do I do now that I can't use this card?\tcards\tcards\nHow long is a delivery to the US?\tcards\tcards\nCan I revive a physical card.\tcards\tcards\nCan I pick between Visa and Mastercard?\tcards\tcards\nDo you know the process how to activate my card?\tcards\tcards\nWhat is the maximum transactions I can use on a disposable card?\tcards\tcards\nHow much would an extra card cost?\tcards\tcards\nDo you give out Visa or Mastercards?\tcards\tcards\nI haven't received the PIN yet.\tcards\tcards\nCan I already use my account although the identity verification has not passed yet?\taccount_security\taccount_security\nCan I call to get my card activated?\tcards\tcards\nWho can purchase a disposable virtual card?\tcards\tcards\nI need to order a new card as my old one will expire soon. Can you tell me how to order a new one?\tcards\tcards\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"hook_started\",\"hook_id\":\"46647